      "message": "Now that I\u0027m back from holiday. I\u0027m digging into this more. From the msan backtrace:\nhttps://paste.googleplex.com/6667167461277696\n\nIt looks like the uninitialized memory comes from SwiftShader by way of Vulkan.\n#1 0x7f40ce1532b1 in allocate third_party/swiftshader/src/System/Memory.cpp:81:42\n\nI see later that there is a MSAN report that shows the glyph cache serialization software. Can I get the full MSAN report?\n\nSo, the SwiftShader MSAN report and the report in the bug that shows glyph serialization are unrelated?",
